--   * ~25,000+ Review Sessions & ~35,000+ Review Logs:
--       - Spans up to 300 days of review history leading mathematically to
--         each card's current interval_days, review_count, and lapses.
--   * 360 Random Practice Sessions (12 sessions x 30 users):
--       - Non-SRS cramming sessions isolated from SRS review logs.
-- ============================================================================

